{"ticker":"ON","updated":"2026-11-14T01:18:53Z","profile":{"longName":"ON Semiconductor Corporation","shortName":"ON Semiconductor Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.onsemi.com","fullTimeEmployees":22600,"marketCap":27662555136,"trailingPE":41.555553,"forwardPE":15.005458,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.343176,"pegRatio":0.15,"targetMeanPrice":96.16,"targetHighPrice":125.0,"targetLowPrice":75.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.111,"earningsGrowth":0.261,"grossMargins":0.39898,"operatingMargins":0.20412001,"profitMargins":0.10819,"totalRevenue":6369200128,"beta":2.151,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":134.92,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":44.56,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"ON Semiconductor Corporation provides intelligent sensing and power solutions in Hong Kong, Singapore, the United Kingdom, the United States, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Power Solutions Group, Analog and Mixed-Signal Group, and Intelligent Sensing Group. The Power Solutions Group segment offers discrete, module, and integrated semiconductor devices designed to enable power conversion, including power switching, signal conditioning, and circuit protection technologies. Its Analog and Mixed-Signal Group segment designs and develops analog and mixed-signal solutions, including power management, sensor interface, connectivity, and standard products for automotive, industrial automation, AI data centers, computing, and mobile end markets. The Intelligent Sensing Group segment develops complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor image sensors, image signal processors, short-wave infrared sensors, and other products, as well as photon-counting technologies, including single-photon avalanche diode arrays and silicon photomultiplier devices for depth sensing, factory automation, safety systems, and robotics industries. ON Semiconductor Corporation was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Scottsdale, Arizona.","summary_zh":"安森美半導體公司在香港、新加坡、英國、美國和國際上提供智慧感測和電源解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：電源解決方案部門、類比和混合訊號部門以及智慧感測部門。電源解決方案部門提供分離式、模組和整合式半導體元件，旨在實現電源轉換，包括電源開關、訊號調節和電路保護技術。其類比和混合訊號部門設計和開發類比和混合訊號解決方案，包括電源管理、感測器介面、連接以及汽車、工業自動化、人工智慧資料中心、運算和行動終端市場的標準產品。智慧感測部門開發互補金屬氧化物半導體影像感測器、影像訊號處理器、短波紅外線感測器和其他產品，以及光子計數技術，包括用於深度感測、工廠自動化、安全系統和機器人產業的單光子雪崩二極體陣列和矽光電倍增器設備。安森美半導體公司成立於 1992 年，總部位於亞利桑那州斯科茨代爾。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":48.25,"h":48.82,"l":47.2,"c":48.11,"v":9330200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":48.5,"h":49.84,"l":48.33,"c":49.56,"v":8170100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":49.59,"h":51.6,"l":49.03,"c":49.8,"v":6154700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":51.4,"h":52.62,"l":50.67,"c":51.83,"v":10782400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":51.61,"h":51.65,"l":50.31,"c":51.07,"v":18145200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":51.23,"h":52.18,"l":51.07,"c":51.5,"v":6140700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":51.88,"h":52.82,"l":50.37,"c":50.42,"v":9373800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":50.42,"h":51.48,"l":50.13,"c":50.94,"v":5519700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":50.31,"h":50.31,"l":49.2,"c":49.77,"v":7393100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":49.58,"h":50.38,"l":49.13,"c":50.16,"v":6151700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":50.8,"h":50.9,"l":49.68,"c":49.76,"v":5515100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":49.5,"h":49.62,"l":47.9,"c":49.31,"v":8570500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":49.35,"h":50.07,"l":47.94,"c":48.35,"v":8415200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":49.15,"h":49.86,"l":48.09,"c":48.74,"v":9707600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":49.03,"h":49.92,"l":48.82,"c":49.27,"v":5297900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":50.13,"h":50.7,"l":48.84,"c":50.35,"v":7677700},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":50.49,"h":50.66,"l":47.73,"c":48.17,"v":8626400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":48.44,"h":51.26,"l":48.27,"c":50.88,"v":8823400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":50.88,"h":51.15,"l":49.12,"c":49.97,"v":5385600},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":50.0,"h":50.49,"l":45.64,"c":45.74,"v":13823800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":47.9,"h":50.66,"l":47.6,"c":50.11,"v":11877100},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":48.74,"h":